From 93d48dfe9e544895fcc4e743444af2696177ec24 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: homar <homar@local>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 21:18:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] homalawn icon tint: themed icons follow colour changes;
 desktop icon colours

Themed icon colours come from Lawnchair's accent when an icon is drawn,
but nothing told the icon machinery the colours had changed, and icons
that bake the colours in (icon-pack and clock icons) kept the old tint in
the icon cache across restarts. The accent's swatches, the light/dark
choice and two new settings now go into the launcher's icon state, so a
change reloads the icons at once (ThemeProvider, the settings and the
night-mode configuration trigger the check).

homalawn_icon_color and homalawn_icon_bg_color (shared, "#rrggbb")
override the symbol and plate colours; empty keeps the accent's colour.
